[11.687619, "o", "--- MAP.txt ---\r\n"]
[11.68942, "o", "Mill directories:\r\n\r\n- /app/cardhearth\r\n- /app/ovenpit\r\n- /app/ribjoin\r\n- /app/drawbin\r\n- /app/flatpit\r\n- /app/tblwell\r\n- /app/markcue\r\n- /app/routenote\r\n\r\nHelper: /app/hearth.sh\r\n\r\nRecipe file: /app/cardhearth/card.yg\r\n\r\n`sift` loads tables from /app/tblwell/action.tbl after the helper runs.\r\n\r\nScratch dests: /app/treypit\r\n"]
[11.689794, "o", "--- usage.txt ---\r\n"]
[11.692038, "o", "usage: riftkiln sift SRC DEST\r\n\r\nDEST is an object with yard (string) and members (array). Each members item has kind peg, pen, or clip. A peg has tag and mark strings. A pen has stem (string) and members (same array shape). A clip has stem (string).\r\n\r\nA clip ident that appears after an inner pen close and before that inner pen's enclosing pen closes must be a clip object in the enclosing pen's members array, immediately after that inner pen object. At that cut the enclosing members array has length 2 when the inner pen is the only prior member: the inner pen, then the clip. The inner pen must not grow a clip property.\r\n"]
[11.692408, "o", "--- riftkiln type ---\r\n"]
[11.692853, "o", "bash: file: command not found\r\n"]
[11.695765, "o", "--- top-level ---\r\n"]
