[12.702236, "o", "/app/treypit/flat.json:1:{\"yard\":\"south\",\"members\":[{\"kind\":\"peg\",\"tag\":\"a\",\"mark\":\"1\"},{\"kind\":\"clip\",\"stem\":\"dry\"}]}\r\n/app/flatpit/flat.quern:3:  clip dry\r\n/app/routenote/MAP.txt:16:`sift` loads tables from /app/tblwell/action.tbl after the helper runs.\r\n/app/routenote/BAKE.txt:1:tblbake argv: RECIPE OUTDIR. Writes quarrel.lst then action.tbl, goto.tbl, prod.tbl when the mill accepts the recipe.\r\n/app/routenote/WALK.txt:1:boot.rs includes cursor.rs. sift tokenizes a quern file, drives action.tbl, and writes the destination object.\r\n/app/ribjoin/rewire.rs:4:    t.replace(\"\\\"kind\\\":\\\"clip\\\"\", \"\\\"kind\\\":\\\"clip\\\"\")\r\n/app/ribjoin/cursor.rs:42:        if kind_of(&neu) == \"clip\" {\r\n/app/ribjoin/cursor.rs:45:                    if map_get(last, \"clip\").is_none() {\r\n/app/ribjoin/cursor.rs:49:                                pairs.push((\"clip\".to_string(), Node::Str(st)));\r\n/app/ribjoin/cursor.rs:226:                    \"clip\" => \"CLIP\",\r\n/app/ribjoin/cursor.rs:279:            (\"kind\".into(), Node::Str(\"clip\".into())),\r\n/app/ribjoin/cursor.rs:301:            pairs.push((\"clip\".into(), Node::Str(cl)));\r\n/app/ribjoin/cursor.rs:327:pub fn run_sift(src: &str, dest: &str) -> i32 {\r\n/app/ribjoin/cursor.rs:334:    let act = load_action(&format!(\"{}/action.tbl\", base));\r\n/app/ovenpit/oven.rs:304:    fs::write(format!(\"{}/quarrel.lst\", out), quarrel.join(\"\\n\")).unwrap();\r\n/app/ovenpit/oven.rs:308:    fs::write(format!(\"{}/action.tbl\", out), alines).unwrap();\r\n/app/drawbin/FRONT.txt:1:drawbin is the sift front.\r\n/app/drawbin/usage.txt:1:usage: riftkiln sift SRC DEST\r\n/app/drawbin/usage.txt:3:DEST is an object with yard (string) and members (array). Each members item has kind peg, pen, or clip. A peg has tag and mark strings. A pen has stem (string) and members (same array shape). A clip has stem (string).\r\n/app/drawbin/usage.txt:5:A clip ident that appears after an inner pen close and before that inner pen's enclosing pen closes must be a clip object in the enclosing pen's members array, immediately after that inner pen object. At that cut the enclosing members array has length 2 when the inner pen is the only prior member: the inner pen, then the clip. The inner pen must not grow a clip property.\r\n/app/drawbin/boot.rs:5:    if args.len() < 4 || args[1] != \"sift\" {\r\n/app/drawbin/boot.rs:6:        eprintln!(\"usage: riftkiln sift SRC DEST\");\r\n/app/drawbin/boot.rs:9:    let rc = run_sift(&args[2], &args[3]);\r\n/app/hearth.sh:5:rm -f /app/markcue/brew.ok\r\n/app/hearth.sh:15:touch /app/markcue/brew.ok\r\n/app/hearth.sh:16:/app/bin/riftkiln sift /app/flatpit/flat.quern /app/treypit/flat.json\r\n"]
